   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of stakeholder map report</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity identify potential stakeholders for collaboration in project activities; Highlight opportunities to create synergies among supporting activities within various programs and projects. The Stakeholder Mapping Report will serve as a foundational document to guide and enhance cooperation efforts, ensuring a cohesive and coordinated approach to addressing the needs of NEET women. The activities and centres carried out by stakeholders for women, particularly for NEET women, will be added to the digital portal to ensure raising awareness and dissemination.</narrative>
    </description>
